      <activity id="36895577-a18f-5c01-8e8b-245f6f6ad5cc" activityNameId="9cd7edc6-95bb-538d-8100-0c6af1223bc7" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sugar beet seed IP, at regional storehouse</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sugar beet seed IP, at regional storehouse
Refers to 1 kg of sugar beet seed (fresh weight);
UUID: 0b7f2a2e-fd66-3f26-b5a2-cf62f2ed295a
The seed produced at the farm is transported to the processing centre, treated (pre-cleaning, cleaning, eventually drying, chemical dressing (for integrated production) and bag filling), stored and afterwards transported to the regional storage centre. No data on wastewater production were available. 
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Refers to average seed processing
Time period: Date of the major data sources.
Production volume: Production Volume of 136 t/year, totally  imported
Sampling: Data based on a literature, expert information and enquiry of seed processing plants. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0b7f2a2e-fd66-3f26-b5a2-cf62f2ed295a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
